@startuml
title Feedback and Rating Module : Submit Destination Feedback and Rating

actor "Traveller" as Actor
participant UI as ":feedbackUI"
participant Ctrl as ":feedbackController"
database DB as ":firebaseFirestore"

Actor -> UI: Open destination feedback form
UI --> Actor: Display rating and comment fields
Actor -> UI: Select rating and enter comment
Actor -> UI: Click Submit Feedback
UI -> Ctrl: Submit destination feedback
Ctrl -> Ctrl: validateRatingAndComment()

alt [Rating or comment is invalid]
    Ctrl --> UI: Display feedback validation error
else [Feedback is valid]
    Ctrl -> DB: retrieveRecord(existingFeedback)
    DB --> Ctrl: Existing feedback result

    alt [Duplicate feedback is not allowed]
        Ctrl --> UI: Display feedback already submitted message
    else [Feedback can be submitted]
        Ctrl -> DB: storeRecord(feedback)
        DB --> Ctrl: Feedback save result
        Ctrl --> UI: Display feedback submission result
    end
end
@enduml
